          '<div class="notice" style="margin-top:30px"><strong>What v1.223 says:</strong> The current source anchor map is refreshed to PapersMinimal v3.077, but the canonical proof graph is frozen. No new global E3/E4 audit or physical-occurrence promotion is claimed for the 55 source-integrated labels. The v1.83 audits have older source bases in places. See each report for its exact statement scope.</div>'
